<title>USA: Helix Technology names El-Hillow CFO.</title>
<headline>Helix Technology names El-Hillow CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helix Technology Corp said Michael El-Hillow has joined the company as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Immediately prior to joining Helix, El-Hillow was at A.T. Cross Co as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
